{
  "name": "Natural Weapons",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Even when not shifted, your form is permanently altered to include fangs, claws, or talons. When you make a melee weapon attack with these natural weapons, you roll a d6 and add your Strength or Dexterity modifier to the attack and damage roll (your choice).</p><p>This die changes as you gain shifter levels, as shown in the Natural Weapons column of the Shifter table.</p>",
